WEBVTT

00:07:28.399 --> 00:07:30.509
in v motor, ki bo delo opravljal

00:07:30.509 --> 00:07:33.514
in noben motor ne dela dobro
brez ogrevanja.

00:07:33.514 --> 00:07:35.580
Ogrejte svoj glas.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.718
Pravzaprav, naj vam pokažem,
kako to naredite.

00:07:37.718 --> 00:07:40.536
Če vsi za trenutek vstanete, prosim.

00:07:40.536 --> 00:07:43.452
Pokazal vam bom
šest vokalnih ogrevalnih vaj,

00:07:43.452 --> 00:07:46.925
ki jih sam delam pred vsakim govorom.

00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:49.696
Kadarkoli boste govorili
s kom pomembnim, naredite te vaje.

00:07:49.696 --> 00:07:52.662
Najprej, roke v zrak, globok vdih

00:07:52.662 --> 00:07:55.764
in izdih, ahhhhh, takole.

00:07:55.764 --> 00:07:57.392
Še enkrat.

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.160
Ahhhhh. Zelo dobro.